{"unit_id":"FYTXY__dsh-hindsight-daemon#card-zh","repo":"FYTXY/dsh-hindsight-daemon","commit":"a30930a46176df662fbf749e3656edf9c70673e5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hindsight-daemon 是为 DSH 添加本地 Hindsight 记忆服务和 Web 设置页的插件。它随 DSH 启动 daemon，并在退出时停止 daemon 与内嵌 PostgreSQL。设置页支持查看状态、日志和记忆占用，检测环境、安装依赖、启停服务、管理多个 profile，还能配置并测试 OpenAI 兼容的 LLM。适合希望在本机维护编码记忆库的 DSH 用户；需要 uv、约 3 GB 磁盘空间、LLM API Key，支持 Windows 与 Linux。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:85-95","lib/index.js:148-159","lib/client.js:4-11","lib/config.js:64-87","lib/core/profiles.js:183-203"]}
